<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia MCB Holdings shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia MCB Holdings shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of MCB Holdings Bhd will be suspended from Tuesday on the company's request, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said.</p>
<p>He said the suspension was on the company's request.  </p>
<p>An official at MCB's company secretary's office declined to comment on the reasons for the suspension.</p>
<p>&quot;I am not sure when the top management will make the announcement. But, it is not today,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>MCB is in the business of manufacturing pre-fabricated construction products, investment holding and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
